# Context allowlist for apps/relay/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore for a repo-root context): what `rush install` reads
# — rush.json, the Rush config + lockfile, EVERY project's package.json — plus
# the relay's sources. Keeps out node_modules, common/temp, data/relay.db, .git.
*
!rush.json
!common/config/rush/
!common/scripts/
!apps/*/package.json
!libs/*/package.json
!apps/relay/src/
